{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111507","id":2906454743,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6tPPrX","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111507","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111507.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111507.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111507","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111507/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111507/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111507/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/03923c6ed7b1203f0e85792cf4468895efe47aca","number":111507,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Scene importer: Fix skeleton path when physics body type is dynamic","user":{"login":"nikitalita","id":69168929,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY5MTY4OTI5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/69168929?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nikitalita","html_url":"https://github.com/nikitalita","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nikitalita/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nikitalita/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nikitalita/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nikitalita/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nikitalita/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nikitalita/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nikitalita/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nikitalita/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nikitalita/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch in priority.\r\n\r\nRelevant fixes are cherry-picked for stable branches as needed by maintainers.\r\n\r\nTo speed up the contribution process and avoid CI errors, please set up pre-commit hooks locally:\r\nhttps://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/engine/guidelines/code_style.html\r\n-->\r\nWhen a mesh instance is set to have physics nodes generated with the body type of \"Dynamic\", the scene importer will generate a RigidBody3D and reparent the mesh instance to it. However, when it does so, it does not update the skeleton path on the mesh instance (which is likely \"..\"), so it will just point to the RigidBody3D as the skeleton:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"880\" height=\"646\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/5fb48808-3acd-44b0-bbf2-1531f232f05a\" />\r\n\r\n\r\nI have updated it such that it gets the skeleton node if it exists, and updates the path after the reparenting.\r\n\r\nI should note that this particular section of code hasn't been appreciably updated in 5 years so it affects all Godot versions to 4.0","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":890310502,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw4OTAzMTA1MDI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:import","name":"topic:import","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":12939969,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AxXLB","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/23","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godot